```js
const form = document.querySelector("#signup");
const status = document.querySelector("#status");      // <p id="status" aria-live="polite">.

form?.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
  event.preventDefault();                                 // we'll send it with fetch.
  const data = new FormData(form);
  const email = String(data.get("email") ?? "").trim();
  const field = form.elements.email;

  if (!email.includes("@")) {
    field.setAttribute("aria-invalid", "true");
    status.textContent = "Enter an email address like name@example.com.";
    field.focus();
    return;
  }
  field.removeAttribute("aria-invalid");

  const button = form.querySelector("button[type=submit]");
  button.disabled = true;                                 // no duplicate requests.
  status.textContent = "Creating your account...";
  try {
    await fetch("/api/signup", { method: "POST", body: data });
    status.textContent = "Account created.";
  } finally {
    button.disabled = false;
  }
});
```

| Concern | Tool |
|---|---|
| every submission path. | `submit` on the form. |
| read fields. | `FormData` by name. |
| stop page navigation. | `preventDefault()`. |
| block double submit. | disable the button until done. |
| announce status. | `aria-live` region. |
| point at the error. | `aria-invalid` plus `focus()`. |

